  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to mitigate climate change by reducing carbon emissions through policies and investments which incentivize energy transition in Libya. This will be done in a manner that is complementary to related initiatives including the development of an integrated climate change strategy. The project will also promote other co-benefits including diversifying the economy, decentralizing and improving vital services and insulating the country from the impacts of climate change. In summary, th</narrative>
